---
// PainPoint.astro
---

<section
    id="problem"
    class="bg-[#efefed] py-[clamp(80px,12vw,160px)] px-[clamp(16px,6vw,48px)] overflow-hidden"
>
    <div class="max-w-[900px] mx-auto">
        <!-- Eyebrow -->
        <p
            class="font-inconsolata text-[0.75rem] font-bold tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-accent mb-4 text-center mx-auto sm:text-left sm:mx-0"
        >
            The Core Friction
        </p>

        <h2
            class="font-oswald font-normal uppercase text-[clamp(2.5rem,6vw,4.5rem)] leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.01em] text-[#1a1a18] mb-12 text-center mx-auto sm:text-[clamp(3rem,5vw,4.5rem)] sm:text-left sm:max-w-none sm:w-auto sm:mx-0"
        >
            Acquisition is <br />costing more.<br />
            <span class="text-accent">Repeat revenue is entirely flat.</span>
        </h2>

        <!-- Cards -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-12">
            <!-- Card 1 -->
            <div class="bg-white rounded-[10px] p-8 flex flex-col gap-4">
                <span
                    class="font-oswald text-[2.75rem] leading-none text-accent"
                    >01</span
                >
                <div class="w-7 h-[2px] bg-[#e0dedd]"></div>
                <h3
                    class="font-oswald text-[1rem] uppercase mb-2 text-[#1a1a18] tracking-wide"
                >
                    Plugging Lifecycle Leaks
                </h3>
                <p
                    class="font-inconsolata text-[0.88rem] leading-[1.65] text-[#6b6b65]"
                >
                    Most brands lose pipeline value the moment a purchase lands.
                    I audit and rebuild your complete flow matrix to capture the
                    capital you're leaving behind.
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Card 2 -->
            <div class="bg-white rounded-[10px] p-8 flex flex-col gap-4">
                <span
                    class="font-oswald text-[2.75rem] leading-none text-accent"
                    >02</span
                >
                <div class="w-7 h-[2px] bg-[#e0dedd]"></div>
                <h3
                    class="font-oswald text-[1rem] uppercase mb-2 text-[#1a1a18] tracking-wide"
                >
                    Embedded Flow Optimization
                </h3>
                <p
                    class="font-inconsolata text-[0.88rem] leading-[1.65] text-[#6b6b65]"
                >
                    Static automations decay. I step in fractionally to build
                    high-scale personalization strings that systematically
                    compound LTV over time.
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Card 3 -->
            <div class="bg-white rounded-[10px] p-8 flex flex-col gap-4">
                <span
                    class="font-oswald text-[2.75rem] leading-none text-accent"
                    >03</span
                >
                <div class="w-7 h-[2px] bg-[#e0dedd]"></div>
                <h3
                    class="font-oswald text-[1rem] uppercase mb-2 text-[#1a1a18] tracking-wide"
                >
                    Zero Overhead Scaling
                </h3>
                <p
                    class="font-inconsolata text-[0.88rem] leading-[1.65] text-[#6b6b65]"
                >
                    Executive-level retention execution without the structural
                    cost of full-time headcount or bloated agency retainers
                    dragging on your margin.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Bottom Row -->
        <div
            class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-6"
        >
            <p
                class="font-inconsolata text-[0.82rem] leading-[1.6] text-[#6b6b65] max-w-[420px] border-l-2 border-accent pl-4"
            >
                No lock-ins. No bloat. Just a senior operator embedded in your
                retention stack — accountable to revenue outcomes.
            </p>

            <a
                href="#contact"
                class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 bg-accent font-inconsolata text-[0.8rem] font-bold tracking-[0.12em] uppercase text-white no-underline px-7 py-4 rounded transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-accent focus:ring-offset-2 focus:ring-offset-[#efefed] group whitespace-nowrap"
            >
                Fix my retention framework
                <span
                    class="inline-block transition-transform duration-200 group-hover:translate-x-1"
                    aria-hidden="true">→</span
                >
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .font-inconsolata {
        font-family: "Inconsolata", "Courier New", monospace;
    }
    .font-oswald {
        font-family: "Oswald", sans-serif;
    }
</style>
